resolved if the NT Service Pack 5 patches for "TCP/ip Print Services" are
removed from the NT system.  The symptom you will see with this problem is
that your UNIX print job will be submitted to the spooler, but you never
see any output and the spool files are missing.

There is another issue with printing thru NT systems:  the NT lpd server
will not accept more than one file per print job.

You may also want to provide more information regarding your problem other
than you can't setup your printer.  What are the symptoms you are seeing?


