learned that
Sun, HP, SGI et al can put more processors
into a single system than Digital. It's to hope and normal that Sun is able
to generate  higher results when  throwing enough processors at the
problem. What i see from SPECrate95_int is that Sun needs
around 1.5-2 times the number of processors to achieve the same
