for example Digital Unix has ,ironically,
the largest SAP R/3 market share among
all UNIX R/3 installations in Swzl. If you count number of SAP R/3
seats , things look even more embarrasing to others, since almost all
large scale R/3 sites in Swzl are on Digital UNIX.
