> it 'the right way'..
>

To summarize, depending on the selected benchmarkand by very carefull segmentation like requiring
a
specific number of CPU's you can prove that Digital
have a performance lead in certain categories.

However using benchmarks that measure a platforms
maximum throughput like TPC-C, TPC-D, SAP/SD
etc you cannot.

