      benchmarks
2.    Those that have been run with the exception
      of TPC-C have not been run with up to date
      machines
2.    Digital don't even have a performance
      lead in the one they have run with the
      latest 8400/625 (TPC-C).
3.    Why anyone should take Digitals
      performance claims seriously if
      Digital cannot be bothered to do the
