> single node performance ?
>

Providing you persuade Oracle, Sybase and Informix to chargethe same for clustered and non
clustered versions of their
DBMS's (currently its about 50% more).

Providing you persuade customers to swallow the
costs of the additional complexity of managing
a cluster.

Providing you persuade customers to swallow the
costs of re-architecting their database to make
best use of the cluster (partitioning databases)
