Load of bullshit on benchmarks ommitted.

>
>Even the one customer who uses SPECrate to by servers
>that I deal with would not be interested in Digitals cluster
>numbers since they are sizing for databases and they
>know that going to a cluster is a bad idea given the
>cost and complexity of doing so.
