their R&D spend to provide a useable system rather than
one that concentrates on screaming CPU performance
at the expense of say a decent backplane architecture.

Take another expample, why is it that Digital with the
fastest CPU have Viewperf/CDRS performance numbers
that are lower than Sun, HP/UNIX, SGI, HP/Intel, IBM,
MaxVision and Intergraph. Hint they needed to spend
