SPECint95_rate:(from specbench.org)
8400(single node/14cpu)  SPECrate95_int: 2143
8400(cluster/8x12cpu) SPECrate95_int: 11330
to match those from Sun you need:
6000 (24cpu/250mhz) SPECrate95_int: 2171
10000(cluster/2x64cpu/250mhz) SPECrate95_int: 8381
so, in SPECrate95_int even a ue10k(128cpu) cluster fails
by a wide margin to beat a 96cpu alpha cluster.

