Hi Valentin,

Your problem is common when installing new Alpha system boards. You
will need to type in exactly what the osloader path was on your
old system board.  Usually you need to add "40" the \winnt in the
boot path, i.e. \os\winnt40\osloader.exe.  If this doesn't work,
and you have a repair diskette, there should be a hidden file called
setup.log which will have the correct path. (attrib -s -h to view.)

bill


