Alpha run nice and fast!  I am beginning to think that the name
Microsoft
is synonomous with the word SLOW.  Anyway it seems that I need (want!) a
faster CPU.   

Reguardless of the reasons behind my CPU purchase I can't seem
to locate anyone who knows what can be fitted to an Alpha XL 366
system.

I have hunted EVERYWHERE but with no luck!    Yes I read the entire
www.digital.com site, all of the workstation site and the CPU site
as well.  There are no dummy instructions that say plainly:

  For the Alpha XL boxes with the model 5 motherboards you can
  use this, this, and this CPU.

- Does anyone know what CPUs (or CPU Kits) I can use 
  in an Alpha XL model 5?

- Does anyone know what venders carry such CPUs or CPU Kits?



Thankz,
